          "url": "https://github.com/respeak-io/episko/blob/974192b540db99dd89b2c29adc7e154c1ac287c0/README.md#L69-L73"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_a49707b3f61e3d06da0cbd111d802202edbe15e5a54a03b83c14fb4507fd2a22"
      ],
      "text": "The app is built on Tauri v2 with a Rust backend and system WebView frontend, uses portable-pty for PTYs (forkpty on macOS, ConPTY on Windows), tiny_http as a localhost telemetry receiver, and xterm.js for terminal rendering."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_2dcc3989d0b6b40663e797f5005a2a58a72f5c14f8a00c44668b7b263e68a213",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "interfaces",
      "kind": "observation",
      "locators": [
        {
          "commit": "974192b540db99dd89b2c29adc7e154c1ac287c0",
          "git_sha": "0e7e40f0dfa7cbc62342c3ae4839fd7adba54685",
          "line_end": 5,
          "line_start": 5,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "respeak-io/episko",
          "url": "https://github.com/respeak-io/episko/blob/974192b540db99dd89b2c29adc7e154c1ac287c0/README.md#L5-L5"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_44263469b7f1573b6f9102cbec2b75435175ce455147a3742d636af39f3a4445"
      ],
      "text": "Episko gives each coding-agent session its own real terminal; Claude Code and Codex are first-class integrated providers, while other installed CLIs work through a terminal-only adapter pane."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_5fdb4a55b5f93b8e54ab4685d3897a0a1f243dcb65affd7316d34188af16d0ca",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "tools-permissions",
      "kind": "observation",
      "locators": [
        {
          "commit": "974192b540db99dd89b2c29adc7e154c1ac287c0",
          "git_sha": "0e7e40f0dfa7cbc62342c3ae4839fd7adba54685",
          "line_end": 28,
          "line_start": 13,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "respeak-io/episko",
          "url": "https://github.com/respeak-io/episko/blob/974192b540db99dd89b2c29adc7e154c1ac287c0/README.md#L13-L28"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_d81fec555331ff11678c41fdc26c05a6d7824f7c7929414a1ca35e0d34869f3c"
      ],
      "text": "When Claude or Codex requests to run something, the app surfaces the command with a risk read and lets the user allow, deny, or hand it to the terminal; starting permission/sandbox policy is stored per integrated agent."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_e49b74051b68b59b2510320f15ea466d3feb96182df10ee601e2eb6e1d9226fe",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "orchestration",
      "kind": "observation",
      "locators": [
        {
          "commit": "974192b540db99dd89b2c29adc7e154c1ac287c0",
          "git_sha": "0e7e40f0dfa7cbc62342c3ae4839fd7adba54685",
          "line_end": 61,
          "line_start": 61,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "respeak-io/episko",
          "url": "https://github.com/respeak-io/episko/blob/974192b540db99dd89b2c29adc7e154c1ac287c0/README.md#L61-L61"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_7d5e7db638f1f6f8622d411683c5b2f4ba6a59e07676b32a17d19687a3556dc1"
      ],
      "text": "On each Claude launch the app writes a throwaway --settings file whose statusLine command and lifecycle hooks POST to a tiny_http server on an ephemeral localhost port; Codex launches use a loopback App Server, and both transports feed one provider-neutral event reducer."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_58d49cb0f4bbf07aa2f5bbceb66c3bb570d386c58df373e7437011bad4b2d702",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "orchestration",
      "kind": "observation",
      "locators": [
        {
          "commit": "974192b540db99dd89b2c29adc7e154c1ac287c0",
          "git_sha": "0e7e40f0dfa7cbc62342c3ae4839fd7adba54685",
          "line_end": 63,
          "line_start": 63,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "respeak-io/episko",
          "url": "https://github.com/respeak-io/episko/blob/974192b540db99dd89b2c29adc7e154c1ac287c0/README.md#L63-L63"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_f772959393d6d131f590e167a39fd0675cf472e6fe8122deadfbfe3bd8a0e971"
      ],
      "text": "Telemetry POSTs are tagged with a launch id so events route to the correct pane, and routing survives /clear, /compact and /resume, each of which makes Claude mint a new runtime session_id; the permission hook is a blocking call held open until answered."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_3fc01ec2cf3f6d16e7e7d84b6c7883a00215834cb8cdad4775c380061ee79393",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "interfaces",
      "kind": "observation",
      "locators": [
