          "git_sha": "0e7e40f0dfa7cbc62342c3ae4839fd7adba54685",
          "line_end": 45,
          "line_start": 45,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "respeak-io/episko",
          "url": "https://github.com/respeak-io/episko/blob/974192b540db99dd89b2c29adc7e154c1ac287c0/README.md#L45-L45"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_80ef9988802e8a6e5892d9d1ec830fbdd933a8ca2cf31dd3508c498ca7b90933",
        "slc_9c4c1bea01026a2293c16dc7b34ecc28318fef03c6a887b4ab27b75dacb2d648"
      ],
      "text": "The app discovers and runs tasks the project already ships — .episko/tasks.toml, .vscode/tasks.json and launch.json, package.json scripts, justfile, Taskfile.yml, mise.toml, Makefile, Cargo.toml — in the same PTY panes as agent sessions."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_02a67e5fbd8668710ef87e77d6a7f37949cf8271012baeaaa6a29ba1a0cc7255",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "design-choices",
      "kind": "observation",
      "locators": [
        {
          "commit": "974192b540db99dd89b2c29adc7e154c1ac287c0",
          "git_sha": "0e7e40f0dfa7cbc62342c3ae4839fd7adba54685",
          "line_end": 55,
          "line_start": 53,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "respeak-io/episko",
          "url": "https://github.com/respeak-io/episko/blob/974192b540db99dd89b2c29adc7e154c1ac287c0/README.md#L53-L55"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_6302e04c66335cb7455fe0e748c18734c5425be52c505b9eecb07f97f7531cc2"
      ],
      "text": "Task discovery never executes the project: just --dump, task --list and mise tasks ls sit behind a trust gate, Makefiles are parsed statically, and tasks that cannot run are shown greyed with the reason rather than hidden."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
