        "slc_369f89eacc7d9dafc5f06bc4125cef50997f6b9b08b1edd1cab9c5b7d27e5163",
        "slc_9b2d159e8168cef1bbfba60d7eba085b65ad86dd0c897ebf6b9d2926611c2628"
      ],
      "text": "Release builds target Apple-silicon macOS and Windows x64; Intel Macs are not covered and Linux is not packaged. The macOS build is self-signed but not notarized, so Gatekeeper quarantines the download and users must clear the quarantine flag before opening."
    },
