        "slc_abc41734915764b5ce3138f6bd0a791053a86bbe5a525520856575550055c7f8"
      ],
      "text": "Each project gets a dashboard with per-day commit and session summaries, issues with triage suggestions, GitHub claims that mark an issue as taken by an agent, and worktree checkouts; feature depth degrades for plain git repos and bare folders."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
