        "slc_0a63f0b5c11ecfd3c4ae7ad7d335fdcbc18b74ee814f2191f7359901a7dee250"
      ],
      "text": "The app detects external Claude sessions started outside Episko and shows them as read-only mirrors in the sidebar, and can jump to the terminal tab or window hosting such a session."
    },
